        "id": "intro",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Anima Lllite- Depth Control to Image\n\nGenerate anime-style illustrations from a depth map using the Anima LLLite model, which applies a lightweight ControlNet correction for precise spatial control. Input 1 image to produce 2 image outputs plus a comparison view. Ideal for 3D scene reconstruction, VFX depth passes, and AR asset preparation. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/image_anima_lllite_depth_control_to_image.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
